            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://finditparts.com/api/v1/shipping_methods",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "line_items",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Repeated object-valued parameter. FinditParts documents the encoding as Rails bracket form, e.g. line_items[][variant_id]=123&line_items[][quantity]=1 — or line_items[][finditparts_product_id]=456&line_items[][quantity]=1. May also be supplied inside the JWT data payload instead."
              },
              {
                "name": "zipcode",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query"
              },
              {
                "name": "address1",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query"
              },
              {
                "name": "address2",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query"
              },
              {
                "name": "state",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query"
              },
              {
                "name": "city",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query"
              },
              {
                "name": "country",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query"
              },
              {
                "name": "address_type",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Returns a list of shipping methods and estimated costs for a given order and address.\n\nThis API can be accessed using a JWT or an API key.\n\nAPI Key Authentication\nRequires an API Key in the Authorization header.\n\nParameters line_items and address should be sent as query parameters if using API Key Authentication.\n\nExample API Key Request\nSingle variant:\nGET /api/v1/shipping_methods.json?line_items[][variant_id]=123&line_items[][quantity]=1&address[zipcode]=93101\n\nMultiple variants via product_id"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "info": {
        "name": "Reseller Customer Sessions",
        "type": "folder"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Get Reseller Customer Session",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://finditparts.com/api/v1/reseller_customer_sessions/:reseller_customer_session_id",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "reseller_customer_session_id",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Returns status and details of a session. For NEW_ORDER intent sessions, this will also return the order details including status and shipments. Use a Generic JWT token (no customer reference)."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Cancels Reseller Customer Session Intent",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "https://finditparts.com/api/v1/reseller_customer_sessions/:reseller_customer_session_id",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "reseller_customer_session_id",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Returns new order status or user status depending on intent. For NEW_ORDER intent sessions, this request will attempt to cancel an order that was submitted or return an error if unable to cancel. Use a Generic JWT token (no customer reference)."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Create Reseller Customer Session",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://finditparts.com/api/v1/reseller_customer_sessions"
          },
          "docs": "Creates a new Reseller Customer Session with intent of USER_SETUP or NEW_ORDER.\n\nReturns session details including redirect_url for embedding or redirecting.\n\nWorkflow\nEach Reseller Customer Session is generated on behalf of a \"Customer Reference\". A Customer Reference should be a unique handle to your customer which will then be linked to a FinditParts account. Common identifiers could be a user ID or an email. This is the reference you will use in the future to place orders on behalf of the li"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "info": {
        "name": "Sessions",
        "type": "folder"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Refresh Session",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://finditparts.com/api/v1/sessions/refresh"
          },
          "docs": "Returns a new user and user specific JWT token that can be used in the Authentication header to perform API calls on behalf of a user or return user specific pricing.\n\nUser specific session JWTs have a default expiration of 1 month. Re-run this call prior to expiration to continually fetch new sessions as needed.\n\nRequires an existing and unexpired user specific JWT in the Authorization header."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Get Current Session",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://finditparts.com/api/v1/sessions/current"
          },
          "docs": "Returns current session for user specific session JWT.\n\nRequires a user specific session JWT in the Authorization header."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Create Session",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://finditparts.com/api/v1/sessions",
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Returns a user and user specific JWT token that can be used in the Authentication header to perform API calls on behalf of a user or return user specific pricing.\n\nUser specific sessions have a default expiration of 1 month. Use the refreshSession API call to refresh credentials before expiration if desired.\n\nRequires an API key in the Authorization header."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Destroy Sessions",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "https://finditparts.com/api/v1/sessions"
          },
          "docs": "Destroys current sessions for user.\n\nRequires a user specific API key in the Authorization header."
        }
      ]
